Pit Wall includes data derived from third-party sources.

data/races/*.csv and data/telemetry/*.csv
  Derived from TracingInsights public F1 data repositories
  (https://github.com/TracingInsights), licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
  Fields were renamed and a subset of columns was kept; telemetry was reduced
  to per-corner metrics by scripts/build_corner_metrics.py.
  TracingInsights builds its files with FastF1 (https://github.com/theOehrly/Fast-F1)
  from Formula 1 live timing data.

data/debriefs/*.json
  Illustrative notes written for this project to demonstrate the debrief
  checker. They are not real team radio or driver statements.

